<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: SKI JUMPING-LEADING WORLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SKI JUMPING-LEADING WORLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HARRACHOV, Czech Republic 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results</p>
<p>in a world cup giant hill (120 metres) ski jumping event on</p>
<p>Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Kazuyoshi Funaki (Japan) 297.70 points (first jump</p>
<p>140.00/second 141.50)</p>
<p> 2. Primoz Peterka (Slovenia)    289.80 (135.50/138.00)</p>
<p> 3. Takanobu Okabe (Japan)	 273.00 (128.50/134.00)</p>
<p> 4. Hiroya Saitoh (Japan)	  266.80 (132.50/128.50)</p>
<p> 5. Robert Mateja (Poland)	 263.30 (123.50/135.00)</p>
<p> 6. Noriaki Kasai (Japan)	  261.20 (123.50/130.50)</p>
<p> 7. Jakub Suchacek (Czech Rep)   260.30 (125.00/131.00)</p>
<p> 8. Lasse Ottesen (Norway)	 259.60 (128.50/126.50)</p>
<p> 9. Janne Ahonen (Finland)	 254.30 (124.50/131.50)</p>
<p>10. Andreas Goldberger (Austria)250.70 (119.00/130.00)</p>
